The high-level task:
{'description': 'With the carved_pumpkin in the inventory, place it at the coordinates (20, -58, 20), oriented to face south.', 'meta-data': {}}


Agent ability: (This is just telling you what the agent can do in one step, subtask should be harder than one step)
None
"""
